    ],
    "type": "object",
  },
  "proposal": "Propose an optional action card, displayed after your final answer. Follow the selected action’s skill for eligibility and planning. Submission saves a proposal only; the user must click its card to start. Do not execute or claim execution from a proposal. A successful result supplies the card; a rejection creates none.",
}
`;

